ph\" >Take total control of every single step:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop-chop-chop the veggies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stir-stir-stir the filling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinch-pinch-pinch the wrappers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plop-plop-plop them into the pot!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come on, let's get the whole process rolling! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/98104e9caef9c9c9864554197f76fe8c.poster.avif?t=1784253168\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/98104e9caef9c9c9864554197f76fe8c.webm?t=1784253168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/98104e9caef9c9c9864554197f76fe8c.mp4?t=1784253168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/244b38cf1d291ecacc96a4998e279455.avif?t=1784253168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras_big/244b38cf1d291ecacc96a4998e279455.webp?t=1784253168 width=1560 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every customer has their own unique personality and preferences. Have a little chat with them, and watch your business thrive~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/9c6e06c95c00ba69c058a10a3888d6a5.poster.avif?t=1784253168\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/9c6e06c95c00ba69c058a10a3888d6a5.webm?t=1784253168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/9c6e06c95c00ba69c058a10a3888d6a5.mp4?t=1784253168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/66195c08feada24144ea3c87f094938a.avif?t=1784253168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras_big/66195c08feada24144ea3c87f094938a.webp?t=1784253168 width=1560 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your jiaozi legend dates back to January 1, Year 2025 of the Jiaozi Era. On that dark, stormy... wait, <i>broad daylight</i> day, you walked into Da Fu's Jiaozi Shop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                                                              —and that is where it all began!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/77d8fa9e38d6cb37929b9d2ff875e010.poster.avif?t=1784253168\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/77d8fa9e38d6cb37929b9d2ff875e010.webm?t=1784253168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/77d8fa9e38d6cb37929b9d2ff875e010.mp4?t=1784253168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious customers arrive every single day, bringing fresh surprises daily!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/ea56d19d5eb95a7af0c53398544180ad.poster.avif?t=1784253168\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/ea56d19d5eb95a7af0c53398544180ad.webm?t=1784253168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/ea56d19d5eb95a7af0c53398544180ad.mp4?t=1784253168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/05b7ff7ae6acae0d25a126befe5562ac.avif?t=1784253168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras_big/05b7ff7ae6acae0d25a126befe5562ac.webp?t=1784253168 width=1560 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>20+ ingredients</strong>, <strong>30+ automation upgrades</strong>, <strong>40+ recipes</strong>, and <strong>100+ talent enhancements</strong>... you'll be cranking these jiaozi out non-stop, completely mesmerized! Trust me, hard work pays off. Every plate of jiaozi you make will reward your dedication!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/ba2353e53894882cd751a8ebc65c1a17.poster.avif?t=1784253168\" width=720 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/ba2353e53894882cd751a8ebc65c1a17.webm?t=1784253168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/ba2353e53894882cd751a8ebc65c1a17.mp4?t=1784253168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/ca3a6dccb99ce4f175801d1b6140773b.avif?t=1784253168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras_big/ca3a6dccb99ce4f175801d1b6140773b.webp?t=1784253168 width=1560 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's the most important thing about playing games? Having fun!! Why mindlessly grind for automation? And what even are diamonds anyway—are they supposed to be a big deal? Here, once your skills are up to par, <strong>everything is absolutely free!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/99d55fea1d8243897d2acd171fe550ce.poster.avif?t=1784253168\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/99d55fea1d8243897d2acd171fe550ce.webm?t=1784253168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/99d55fea1d8243897d2acd171fe550ce.mp4?t=1784253168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/7f98e8087864571013a589e199001b64.avif?t=1784253168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras_big/7f98e8087864571013a589e199001b64.webp?t=1784253168 width=1560 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Highly Recommended: Normal Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand over the tedious jiaozi-making steps directly to your staff. So, what do you do? You personally take charge of the specific details your customers care about the most! High efficiency, amazing results!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛋️ What? You're feeling a bit lazy?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then go for Casual Mode. Stop living life on the edge. Take your time and handle the entire process yourself at your own pace. And hey, since you did all the work yourself, it's only fair to charge a little extra, right?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ What? You're in a bit of a hurry?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then try Busy Mode. Dispel the time-freezing magic in the lobby, stack up those coin buffs, and go-go-go! Quickly figure out what the customers want—the faster you make them, the more you earn!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 What? You want it all?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No problem! You can switch modes every single day. Be casual when you want to relax, and get busy when you want to hustle. Sounds like a plan?~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/bbf5dc565519b343f4d3e8a45eed877a.poster.avif?t=1784253168\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/bbf5dc565519b343f4d3e8a45eed877a.webm?t=1784253168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/bbf5dc565519b343f4d3e8a45eed877a.mp4?t=1784253168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras/4eb73c6cb8852c472c950827411efd82.avif?t=1784253168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066190/extras_big/4eb73c6cb8852c472c950827411efd82.webp?t=1784253168 width=1560 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever had a sudden urge to just try something new? On Planet Jia